== 7. Rerun after the two fixes of 7 Nov, 2026-11-07 05:15 UTC
Above, two failures: (a) v1m4 (1 VC) fails N07 on every seed with 'coverage hole: N07 packets
interleaved at a sink': with one VC packets cannot interleave, so N07 now checks that none did;
(b) run.tcl with -define failed against the stubs: it put the whole xvlog command in an options
file, a path B1 never used. Now the command line is as in B1 and only the defines go in the
options file; the xvlog stub now splits arguments like a Windows batch file and reads --file.
Unchanged since the run above: every RTL file, and every testbench line that runs with 4 VCs.

